
                 DayDream BBS V1.00, Display.DAT Structure
                 -----------------------------------------

OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0000   BYTE       01    DISPLAY MODE ID NUMBER                            (-)
 0001   STRING     08    NAME OF THE DAYDREAM:DISPLAY/ SUBDIRECTORY        (-)
 0010   WORD       02    DISPLAY MODE ATTRIBUTES (SEE THE TABLE BELOW)     (-)
 0012   BYTE       01    CONVERSION TABLE ID 4 INCOMING CHARACTERS (01-99) (-)
 0013   BYTE       01    CONVERSION TABLE ID 4 OUTGOING CHARACTERS (01-99) (-)

                         ^^  If either one of the above  fields is $00, ^^
                         ^^  character conversion for this display mode ^^
                         ^^  will be disabled.                          ^^

 0014   STRING     19    LOCAL FONT                                        (-)
 0034   WORD       02    LOCAL FONT HEIGHT                                 (-)
 0036   UBYTE      01    STRINGDATA TO USE (0 = BUILT-IN STRINGS)          (-)
 0037   FREE BLOCK 63    FREE SPACE FOR FUTURE DEVELOPENT                  (-)
 0100   -- END --  00    END OF THE DISPLAY MODE STRUCTURE                 (-)
==============================================================================


                            Display Mode Flags
                            ------------------

BIT   DESCRIPTION WHEN DOWN            DESCRIPTION WHEN UP       MESSAGE FLAGS
==============================================================================
000   0: NO ANSI SUPPORT               1: ANSI CONTROL CODES ENABLED
001   0: NO INCOMING CONVERSION        1: ACTIVATE INCOMING CONVERSION
002   0: NO OUTGOING CONVERSION        1: ACTIVATE OUTGOING CONVERSION
003   0: NO CONVERSION IN FILES        1: ACTIVATE CONVERSION IN FILES
 .
 .
015
==============================================================================

